      "W": {
        "slot": "W",
        "id": "FizzW",
        "name": "Seastone Trident",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Fizz's attacks bleed his enemies, dealing magic damage over several seconds. Fizz can empower his next attack to deal bonus damage and empower his further attacks for a short time.",
        "bodyHtml": "<span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-500 italic\">Passive</span>: Fizz's Attacks cause his enemies to bleed, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(30/45/60/75/90 + ([[si:scaleap]]25% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> over 3 seconds. <br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-semibold\">Active</span>: Fizz's next Attack deals an additional <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(50/75/100/125/150 + ([[si:scaleap]]45% Ability Power)) magic damage</span>. If this Attack kills its target, Fizz refunds <span>30/40/50/60/70 Mana</span> and reduces the cooldown of this Ability to 1 second. If it does not kill, Fizz's Attacks deal an additional <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(20/25/30/35/40 + ([[si:scaleap]]30% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> for 5 seconds.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Attacks deal 90 bonus damage to jungle monsters.<br />Attacks deal 50% damage to structures.</span>",
