        "name": "Playful / Trickster",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Fizz hops into the air, landing gracefully upon his spear and becoming untargetable. From this position, Fizz can either slam the ground or choose to jump again before smashing back down.",
        "bodyHtml": "Fizz hops onto his trident, becoming Untargetable for 0.75 seconds, after which he deals <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(80/130/180/230/280 + ([[si:scaleap]]95% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> to nearby enemies and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slows</span> them by 40/45/50/55/60% for 2 seconds. <br /><br />Fizz can <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-300\">Recast</span> this Ability while Untargetable to dash again, which ends the effect early, deals damage in a smaller area, and doesn't <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slow</span>.",
