        "name": "Chum the Waters",
        "maxRank": 3,
        "summary": "Fizz tosses a fish in a direction that attaches to any champion that touches it, slowing the target. After a short delay, a shark erupts from the ground, knocking up the target and knocking any nearby enemies aside. All enemies hit are dealt magic damage and slowed.",
        "bodyHtml": "Fizz launches a fish that attaches to the first champion hit. The victim is afflicted with <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400 font-semibold\">True Sight</span> and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slowed</span> by between 40% to 80% based on how far the fish travelled before attaching. <br /><br />After 2 seconds a shark erupts on the target, <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Knocking Up</span> the target with the fish for 1 second, <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Knocking Back</span> everything else, and dealing between <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(180/300/420 + ([[si:scaleap]]60% Ability Power)) to (270/450/630 + (90% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> based on how far the fish travelled before attaching.",
